 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSuministros del Norte SL                                         MASTER SERVICES\nAvenida Diagonal 220, 08001 Barcelona, Spain                     AGREEMENT\nCIF/NIF: ESB87546736\nReg No: ES-022839\n\nFROM                                                          FACTURAR A\nSuministros del Norte SL                                      Suministros del Norte SL\nAvenida Diagonal 220                                          Avenida Diagonal 220\n08001 Barcelona                                               28001 Madrid\nSpain                                                         Spain\nVAT: ESB87546736\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 24/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Suministros del Norte SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220, Barcelona (\"Party A\"), and\nSuministros del Norte SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220, Madrid (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Suministros del Norte SL / Lucía Fernández\nParty B      Suministros del Norte SL / Lucía Fernández\nDate         24/02/2026",
